Install the optional credential gateway and wire MCP Auth to it

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth-gateway [command]

Available Commands:
  apply       Install the credential gateway for the servers that declare auth.credentialGateway

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for mcp-auth-gateway

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth-gateway [command] --help" for more information about a command.
